ada.fit(X_train, y_train)gbm.fit(X_train, y_train)xgb.fit(X_train, y_train)



Explanation:
- fit() trains the machine learning model.
- X_train contains input features.
- y_train contains correct output labels.
All three models are trained using the same training dataset.

